        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-nonlinear-fft-wavelength-of-the-saturated-u-field>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-eldredgeops-rana-18file-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-rk4-vs-eigenvalue-dispersion-pearson-r>,
